042026152236_PR_30042026.pdf","ts":"2026-04-30T15:27"}]},{"q":"FY27Q1","ql":"Q1 FY27","basis":"consolidated","rev":48211.0,"ebitda":11409.0,"pat":7769.0,"eps":19.19,"m":23.7,"m_y":15.0,"rev_y":14.0,"rev_q":3.9,"ebitda_y":14.7,"pat_y":12.3,"pat_q":-8.6,"label":"Good","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1700136_23072026054446_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-07-23T16:20:26","src":"NSE announcement","day":-0.6,"w1":8.6,"m1":8.6},"docs":[{"k":"result","t":"Outcome of Board Meeting","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_23072026161911_Outcome23072026V1_1.pdf","ts":"2026-07-23T16:20"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","ts":"2026-07-28T20:24"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"summary","statement":"PAT +9% to Rs 6,921 cr, revenue +8% to Rs 42,279 cr; FY27 CC guidance held at 1.5-3.5%, margin band 20-22%.","quote":"Infosys — Q1 FY27 (call 23 Jul 2026) Steady but unspectacular: single-digit growth with guidance intact. The read-through is a still-cautious enterprise-spend environment where large deals (incl. the Truist GCC win) haven't yet lifted the growth rate. Numbers. Revenue Rs 42,279 cr (+8% YoY); net profit Rs 6,921 cr (+9% YoY). Guidance (the KPI markets trade on). FY27 constant-currency revenue growt","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Infosys improved its utilization rate excluding trainees by 1.9% to 84.9% due to a strong focus on operational efficiency.","quote":"Our tight focus on improving operational efficiency led to utilization, excluding trainees, improving by 1.9% to 84.9%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":31.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The company experienced soft volumes that were weaker than expected and below historical trends for the first quarter.","quote":"Volumes were soft and weaker than expectations and also versus the historical Q1 trends","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":30.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects the business environment to remain volatile, with the lower end of their guidance accounting for potential macroeconomic deterioration.","quote":"Overall business environment continues to remain volatile. The lower end of the guidance assumes further deterioration in macro.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":33.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Infosys revised its full-year constant-currency revenue growth guidance to a range of 1.5% to 3%.","quote":"With our Q1 results and a view for the rest of the financial year, we are changing our revenue growth guidance to 1.5% to 3% Y-on-Y growth in constant currency terms.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Customers are focusing their budgets on AI, cloud, modernization, and productivity projects while being cautious with discretionary spending.","quote":"Clients continue to prioritize investments in AI, modernization, cloud and productivity initiatives while remaining selective in discretionary spending.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":30.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Intense competition and client demands for productivity have led to a softer price increase than the company had anticipated.","quote":"Additionally, client expectation on productivity, along with high competitive intensity is resulting in softer increase in price versus our expectations.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":30.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Infosys plans to implement salary increases for the majority of its workforce in October, with the remaining employees receiving them in January 2027.","quote":"We plan to give salary hikes to most of our employees effective October while the rest of the employees will be covered in January '27.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":31.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The company maintained its full-year operating margin guidance at 20% to 22%.","quote":"Our operating margin guidance remains the same at 20% to 22% operating margin.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"The company secured $3.6 billion in large deal wins, with net new deals representing 61% of the total.","quote":"Large deal wins were strong at $3.6 bn with high net new of 61%, reflecting the relevance of our value proposition.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":31.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Infosys ended the quarter with $3.9 billion in consolidated cash and cash equivalents after paying out over $1 billion in dividends.","quote":"Consolidated cash and cash equivalents were at $3.9 bn at the end of the quarter after returning more than $1 bn to the shareholders through dividends.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":31.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Infosys developed the Topaz Fabric platform to help clients utilize AI while maintaining control over their proprietary data.","quote":"We have built a platform, Topaz Fabric that enables our clients to get the benefits of AI while keeping the sovereignty of their own data within their company.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The rise of artificial intelligence is introducing additional deflationary pressures within the industry.","quote":"On the back of AI, there is an additional deflation or the AI led deflation as we call it.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":38.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Geopolitical instability and uncertainty are leading to cautious spending and hesitancy among financial services clients.","quote":"In Financial Services, uncertainty and geopolitical instability is causing some client' hesitancy as spending patterns are taking a more cautious approach.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":32.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"negative","quote":"Overall business environment continues to remain volatile. The lower end of the guidance assumes further deterioration in macro.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Infosys_28072026202438_SE_filing_Earnings_call_transcript.pdf","page":33.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[]}},{"q":"FY27Q2","ql":"Q2 FY27","basis":"consolidated","rev":49244.0,"ebitda":11689.0,"pat":7823.0,"eps":19.32,"m":23.7,"m_y":6.0,"rev_y":10.7,"rev_q":2.1,"ebitda_y":11.0,"pat_y":6.